{"id":"n60092-1-7","stage":0,"title":"건너가다 · 过","scene":"交通与出行","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60092-1-7-1","ko":"신호 바뀌기 전에 빨리 건너가.","zh":"趁信号灯还没变，快过马路。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"신호","meaning":"信号灯","explanation":"신호：信号；这里指交通信号灯。","readings":[{"term":"신호","audio":"/audio/617aa217dbc92e8aaffc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66278","senseId":"1","lemma":"신호","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신호","audio":"/audio/617aa217dbc92e8aaffc.mp3"}},{"text":"바뀌기","meaning":"变换","explanation":"바뀌다：改变；-기 将动作名词化，接 전에 表示变灯之前。","readings":[{"term":"바뀌다","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61179","senseId":"3","lemma":"바뀌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바뀌기","audio":"/audio/226c969ccc7841f1de6d.mp3"}},{"text":"전에","meaning":"在……之前","explanation":"전：之前；-에 与前面的 바뀌기 合起来表示信号灯变化之前。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전에","audio":"/audio/2d406c50ea3b8c668815.mp3"}},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快。","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"건너가.","meaning":"快过去","explanation":"건너가다：从道路一边到另一边；-어 是非敬语命令句末。","readings":[{"term":"건너가다","audio":"/audio/b3d7025fea85beb2a260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60092","senseId":"1","lemma":"건너가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건너가","audio":"/audio/4c0d7d33808a8b0766ad.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"617aa217dbc92e8a","term":"신호","zh":"信号灯","audio":"/audio/617aa217dbc92e8aaffc.mp3","entryId":"66278","definition":"表示交通通行或停止的灯光信号；这里指路口信号灯。","pronunciation":["신ː호"]},{"id":"5207e639323d4244","term":"바뀌다","zh":"改变，转变，更改","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3","entryId":"61179","definition":"内容或状态等变化或变样。","pronunciation":["바뀌다"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"之前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"在某一时间或事件发生以前；바뀌기 전에 指变灯之前。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"b3d7025fea85beb2","term":"건너가다","zh":"过，跨过，渡过","audio":"/audio/b3d7025fea85beb2a260.mp3","entryId":"60092","definition":"从江河或桥、道路等的一边去另一边。","pronunciation":["건ː너가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4a2b7f57a76c652809e3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60092-1-7-2","ko":"아직 파란불이니까 괜찮아.","zh":"现在还是绿灯，没问题的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"파란불이니까","meaning":"因为还是绿灯","explanation":"파란불：交通绿灯；-이니까 表示“因为还是绿灯”。韩语称绿灯为 파란불。","readings":[{"term":"파란불","audio":"/audio/8e8ab2dd0fda9062a140.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82248","senseId":"1","lemma":"파란불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파란불이니까","audio":"/audio/8e40027e8c91697c4720.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮아.","meaning":"没问题","explanation":"괜찮다：没问题；-아 是非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아","audio":"/audio/87dea6f32ecb5a9bbac8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"8e8ab2dd0fda9062","term":"파란불",